B.ZM=s(["Nothing... apart from a face.","A young man with dark hair and cold eyes. He wore a naval coat finer than any officer's, with a golden lion at his collar.","He looked at me as though he knew me. Then everything went dark."],t.s)
B.Oo=new A.cw("Watch Mateo's reaction","intro_mateo_recognizes_prince",!0,!1)
